# Python scrapers

- Follow `.cursorrules/scraping.md` and `.cursorrules/stack.md`.
- One scraper module per platform; normalize to the raw job contract in `.cursorrules/schema.md`.
- POST to n8n webhook only — no LLM calls inside scrapers.
- Secrets via env; never hardcode cookies or keys.
- No separate Flask API — dashboard HTTP lives in `web/app/api/`.
